                "text": "Republicans are trying to hide from the truth of their harmful, deeply unpopular slashes to Medicaid. We won\u2019t let that happen.\n\nThis week\u2019s installment of Straight Talk With Scholten is a deep dive into the Medicaid cuts featuring stories of folks who would be hit the hardest. You\u2019ll hear from Tasha Blackmon, CEO of @CherryHealthMI, a community health center that\u2019s already feeling the squeeze of these proposed cuts. \u2b07\ufe0f",
