                "text": "Pioneer Resources is a leading provider for individuals with disabilities and seniors in the Muskegon area. I\u2019m a proud supporter of the work they do \u2014 including providing housing, transportation, and employment services \u2014 and I\u2019m keeping up the fight to fully fund Medicaid so that those who rely on Pioneer Resources can thrive.",
